SUMMARY:The Scout
DTSTART:20261010T233000Z
DTEND:20261011T011500Z
DTSTAMP:20261010T233000Z
UID:YfOi5QaIgv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nA location scout is tasked with f
 inding the perfect interiors for a television pilot. Over the course of a 
 single day\, she drives around New York City\, interacting with strangers\
 , taking photos of their cozy apartments and eclectic shops\, while attemp
 ting to satisfy the demands of her erratic employers. Director Paula Gonz
 ález-Nasser and Producer/Co-Editor Ryan Martin Brown scheduled to attend 
 for a post-film Q&A on Oct 9.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/t
 he-scout\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
