DTEND:20261003T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20261003T023000Z
UID:7XSnS5ProU
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 91 mins (1h31m)\n\nPresented by Compassionate Disas
 ter Films. A young woman falls in love with the home-health-care nurse se
 nt to care for her Grandmother with dementia. When the nurse mysteriously 
 disappears\, Grandma’s cuckoo clock speaks to her with a warning that Gr
 andma might be responsible.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the
 -cuckoo-clock\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
