 nges in the people around him\, uncovering a terrifying truth spreading th
 roughout the city in Philip Kaufman’s gripping sci-fi chiller.\n\nhttps:
 //www.siff.net/programs-and-events/scarecrowber-2026/invasion-of-the-body-
 snatchers\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
